Workforce Agent Platform
==============

This project includes JSON schema definitions for internal agent evidence packs.

The following schema files are adapted from publicly described Anthropic-style
agent output schema patterns and modified for this project's data model and
Unicode-friendly text fields:

- server/_core/agent/data/schemas/market-sector-reader.schema.json
- server/_core/agent/data/schemas/meeting-news-reader.schema.json

